OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHealey announces #100 energy bill help
OL,4,Afor millions and raises taxes on banks
OL,5,Aand some savers
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, banks will pay an extra 3%
OL,8,Fsurcharge on profits, which will be
OL,9,F"time-limited" - a smaller tax rise
OL,10,Fthan expected
OL,12,FHealey says there will be "fiscal
OL,13,Fdevolution", with business rates
OL,14,Fretained locally by the end of the
OL,15,Fdecade and mayors getting a share of
OL,16,Fincome tax from 2028
OL,18,FTory leader Kemi Badenoch says the
OL,19,FBudget is "not good enough, not strong
OL,20,Fenough, not bold enough" - she also
OL,21,Fsays the UK is "drowning in an
OL,22,Fout-of-control welfare system"
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
